{"tournament": {"id": 13095399, "name": "Kards Open XVI - Top 16", "url": "ddnhb22k", "description": "<h1>CARDS FROM THE BROTHERS IN ARMS SET ARE NOT PERMITTED IN THE OPEN. IF YOUR DECK CONTAINS A CARD FROM THE BROTHERS IN ARMS PRE-RELEASE, YOU WILL BE DISQUALIFIED.</h1><p></p><hr><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">STAGE TWO\u00a0- If you finish in the Top 8 from either stage weekend, you will be qualified for the next stage - Saturday, June 24th to compete in the single elimination best of 5 conquest.\u00a0\u00a0In the top 16, participants play a Single Elimination bracket with closed deck lists in a best of 5 series. However, each win must be with a deck from a different main nation.</p><p>STAGE THREE\u00a0- In the top 4, players submit 4 decks from different main nations and continue to play a Single Elimination bracket, in a best of 5 series, on Sunday June 25th. This final part of the Open is played with open deck lists.</p><p><span style='color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: \"Chakra Petch\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.01em;'><br>PRIZE POOL</span><br></p><p>1st: $600 USD<br>2nd: $450 USD<br>3rd: $250 USD<br>4th: $200 USD<br>5th-8th: 500 Diamonds and 2000 Gold<br>9th-16th: 200 Diamonds and 1000 Gold<br></p><h4>FORMAT &amp; SCHEDULE</h4><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">Top Cuts</p><ul>\r\n<li><p>Bring four decks from four different main nations</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 16 conquest format best of 5 with closed deck lists</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 16 Bracket June 24th\u00a0@ 1300 GMT<br></p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 4 Bracket &amp; Live Stream June 25th @ 1300 GMT</p></li>\r\n</ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">Kards Open Full Rules and Regulations:\u00a0<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_uYNermUzVIdr4K9RwrAI2mKhDlQTWp-oKqRzRA8iso/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://support.kards.com/hc/en-us/articles/8712237212697-KARDS-Tournament-Official-Rules</a></p><ul>\r\n<li><p>The Kards Esports Discord will be the main hub of communication with the tournament admins. This is the required method for contacting an admin if you have questions or a match dispute:\u00a0<a href=\"https://discord.gg/288DQexmng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/288DQexmng</a></p></li>\r\n<li><p>For Chinese players who can not access Discord, there is a Wechat group for tournament communication. Contact: 003546614978</p></li>\r\n</ul>", "tournament_type": "single elimination", "started_at": "2023-06-24T09:03:28.665-04:00", "completed_at": "2023-06-25T13:40:07.104-04:00", "require_score_agreement": false, "notify_users_when_matches_open": true, "created_at": "2023-06-19T07:39:35.122-04:00", "updated_at": "2023-06-25T13:40:07.225-04:00", "state": "complete", "open_signup": false, "notify_users_when_the_tournament_ends": true, "progress_meter": 100, "quick_advance": false, "hold_third_place_match": true, "pts_for_game_win": "0.0", "pts_for_game_tie": "0.0", "pts_for_match_win": "1.0", "pts_for_match_tie": "0.5", "pts_for_bye": "1.0", "swiss_rounds": 0, "private": false, "ranked_by": "match wins", "show_rounds": true, "hide_forum": false, "sequential_pairings": false, "accept_attachments": false, "rr_pts_for_game_win": "0.0", "rr_pts_for_game_tie": "0.0", "rr_pts_for_match_win": "1.0", "rr_pts_for_match_tie": "0.5", "created_by_api": false, "credit_capped": false, "category": null, "hide_seeds": false, "prediction_method": 0, "predictions_opened_at": null, "anonymous_voting": false, "max_predictions_per_user": 1, "signup_cap": 16, "game_id": 240613, "participants_count": 16, "group_stages_enabled": false, "allow_participant_match_reporting": true, "teams": false, "check_in_duration": null, "start_at": "2023-06-24T09:00:00.000-04:00", "started_checking_in_at": null, "tie_breaks": ["match wins vs tied", "game wins", "points scored"], "